 "title": "Jadual Waktu Berbuka Puasa & Imsak Sarawak 2026 - 6 Zon",
 "content": "<div class=\"ilmx-swk\">\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-wrap\">\n<img alt=\"Jadual waktu berbuka Sarawak 2026 Kuching waterfront - Astana heritage Muslim minority guide 6 zon\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhIpVdQ8yc6JU6SMSFl8f9fWkX1ljX6fSt60BbjYMj7ZwhrPD7bKwyMHT4z4-aW2AiLLD_1PPbroNrtXrV8ABj2voso-NbIVUdjhdbfHFyp1FqTLjq-Qd-oc_mc8gLkUS-84_17BDRD3HMTNYrb7VWBkRAF-muX6plCNAG0VxxUTgqfTUis-YSyp9oUIRc/s1600/jadual-waktu-berbuka-puasa-imsak-sarawak.webp\" title=\"Waktu Berbuka &amp; Imsak Sarawak Ramadan 2026\" /><br>\n  \n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-hero\">\n<h2>🌳 Jadual Waktu Berbuka &amp; Imsak Sarawak 2026</h2>\n<p>Ramadan 1447H • Sarawak Bumi Kenyalang • 6 Zon • Panduan Muslim Minority PERTAMA!</p>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-badges\">\n<span class=\"ilmx-swk-badge\">📖 Muslim Minority Guide</span>\n<span class=\"ilmx-swk-badge\">🏘️ Longhouse Communities</span>\n<span class=\"ilmx-swk-badge\">🛢️ Miri Offshore</span>\n<span class=\"ilmx-swk-badge\">⚡ JAKIM Sarawak</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-zone-panel\">\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-zone-title\">🗺️ Pilih Zon Kawasan Anda</div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-zone-sub\">Sarawak Bumi Kenyalang mempunyai <strong>6 zon waktu solat</strong> merentasi negeri terbesar Malaysia!</div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-zone-grid\">\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-zone-btn active\" onclick=\"ilmxSwk(0)\"><span class=\"zid\">SWK01</span><span class=\"znm\">🐱 Kuching</span><span class=\"zar\">Cat City, Ibu Negeri</span></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-zone-btn\" onclick=\"ilmxSwk(1)\"><span class=\"zid\">SWK02</span><span class=\"znm\">🛶 Sibu</span><span class=\"zar\">Rajang River, Sarikei</span></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-zone-btn special\" onclick=\"ilmxSwk(2)\"><span class=\"zid\">SWK03</span><span class=\"znm\">🛢️ Miri</span><span class=\"zar\">Oil &amp; Gas City</span></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-zone-btn\" onclick=\"ilmxSwk(3)\"><span class=\"zid\">SWK04</span><span class=\"znm\">⚡ Bintulu</span><span class=\"zar\">LNG Capital, Shell</span></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-zone-btn\" onclick=\"ilmxSwk(4)\"><span class=\"zid\">SWK05</span><span class=\"znm\">🏘️ Sri Aman</span><span class=\"zar\">Betong, Longhouse</span></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-zone-btn special\" onclick=\"ilmxSwk(5)\"><span class=\"zid\">SWK06</span><span class=\"znm\">🇧🇳 Limbang</span><span class=\"zar\">Brunei Border</span></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"ilmxSwkInfo\" style=\"background:#e8f5e9;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#1b5e20;font-weight:700;border-left:5px solid #4caf50\">\n✅ <strong>SWK01:</strong> Bandar Kuching - Ibu negeri Sarawak!\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-countdown\">\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-cd-hdr\">⏰ Waktu Berbuka - <span id=\"ilmxSwkZN\">SWK01 Kuching</span></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-timer\">\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-tunit\"><span class=\"ilmx-swk-tval\" id=\"ilmxSwkH\">00</span><span class=\"ilmx-swk-tlbl\">JAM</span></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-tunit\"><span class=\"ilmx-swk-tval\">:</span><span class=\"ilmx-swk-tlbl\" style=\"opacity:0\">_</span></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-tunit\"><span class=\"ilmx-swk-tval\" id=\"ilmxSwkM\">00</span><span class=\"ilmx-swk-tlbl\">MINIT</span></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-tunit\"><span class=\"ilmx-swk-tval\">:</span><span class=\"ilmx-swk-tlbl\" style=\"opacity:0\">_</span></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-tunit\"><span class=\"ilmx-swk-tval\" id=\"ilmxSwkS\">00</span><span class=\"ilmx-swk-tlbl\">SAAT</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-today\" id=\"ilmxSwkToday\"><strong>Sarawak:</strong> Pilih zon untuk waktu tepat</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); margin-bottom: 16px;\"><b>{getToc} $title={Table of Contents} $count={Boolean} $expanded={Boolean}</b></div>\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-minority-alert\">\n<h3>📖 PANDUAN KHAS: Muslim Minority di Sarawak (PERTAMA di Malaysia!)</h3>\n<p><strong>Sarawak hanya 30% Muslim</strong> - berbanding Kelantan 99% atau Pahang 75%. Ini panduan PERTAMA untuk Muslim minority navigate Ramadan di negeri majority non-Muslim!</p>\n<p>🍽️ <strong>Cabaran Utama:</strong> Cari makanan halal di kawasan Chinese-majority, locate masjid terdekat, bezakan restoran halal vs non-halal di mixed business districts.</p>\n<p>✅ <strong>Kami Ada Solusi:</strong> Directory restoran halal, peta masjid by city, survival tips untuk Muslim professionals, family &amp; students. You're not alone!</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-cal-wrap\">\n<table class=\"ilmx-swk-table\">\n<thead><tr><th>Hari</th><th>Ramadan</th><th>Tarikh</th><th id=\"ilmxSwkTh2\">Imsak SWK01</th><th id=\"ilmxSwkTH2\">Berbuka SWK01</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody id=\"ilmxSwkTbody\"></tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-art\">\n<h2>🌳 Sarawak - Panduan Muslim Minority PERTAMA di Malaysia!</h2>\n<p><strong>Sarawak Bumi Kenyalang</strong> (Land of the Hornbill) adalah negeri TERBESAR Malaysia (124,450 km²) tetapi hanya <strong>30% penduduk Muslim</strong> - berbeza drastik dari majoriti negeri lain!</p>\n<p>Ini menjadikan Ramadan di Sarawak pengalaman yang sangat unik: Muslim minority navigate Chinese-majority cities, cari halal food dalam mixed districts, locate masjid tersembunyi dalam commercial areas. <strong>This is the FIRST comprehensive guide ever created!</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-box\">\n<h4>📖 Muslim Minority Survival Guide - Cari Halal Food &amp; Masjid!</h4>\n  \n<img alt=\"Sarawak Laksa halal berbuka puasa Ramadan - specialty famous Kuching Miri makanan wajib cuba\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiJ3X6UmUoc9Urgjyj6Kc3LRFZRXe-ACe0r_1ayeQmKjkS88B2HcOrrF4vNRQhSCLKstO3JcHPt2JfqsT0vN4XU7QJKqRn8MX2mDFWy7CoZCfdxEyy-Xxol36IiBFuIV5LKiFJGDm9iK_G8sNKuxe3xG87amQylE7TwOEH-fv200G5bZ1bOSuGxinKAbRc/s1600/sarawak-laksa-halal-ramadan-berbuka.webp\" title=\"Sarawak Laksa Halal Ramadan 2026 - Kuching Specialty Berbuka Must-Try\" /><br>\n  \n<p><strong>Cabaran Ramadan Muslim Minority Sarawak:</strong></p>\n<p>🍽️ <strong>Halal Food Hunting:</strong> Kuching/Miri/Sibu majority Chinese districts - restoran non-halal bercampur dengan halal. Macam mana nak bezakan? Look for: (1) Sijil halal JAKIM dipamerkan jelas, (2) Nama kedai Melayu (Restoran Siti, Warung Pak Ali), (3) Tandanya \"NO PORK\" sahaja BELUM CUKUP - mesti ada sijil JAKIM!</p>\n<p>🕌 <strong>Locate Masjid:</strong> Bukan setiap area ada masjid - unlike Kelantan yang setiap 2km ada. Di Kuching downtown, masjid tersembunyi dalam residential areas. Tips: Download apps \"Masjid Sarawak\" atau tanya local Muslims!</p>\n<p>👥 <strong>Community Support:</strong> Join WhatsApp groups \"Muslim Kuching\", \"Miri Muslim Community\" - ramai saudara bersedia membantu!</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>🏘️ Longhouse Muslim Communities - Tradisi Fusion Unik!</h3>\n  \n<img alt=\"Rumah panjang Melanau Iban Sarawak Ramadan - komuniti mualaf berbuka tradisi unik\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgZCt534Wmx12Qme-h1-Nmik_Irts-TojSOum00XdzTGGzvfedGpXMX9wx3UkE5jFoCoxGrWzLCp-mM3ouPEh656LDQsPgmbLI-4OvDHlr1n8-_FxWLq8fRvp9ezE6QEJ059DkvmFdt5zBL0f10OKO8OEU8fHl-_VMzL8leFcirsHpKc9RcrFCzzgduliw/s1600/ramadan-komuniti-rumah-panjang-melanau-sarawak.webp\" title=\"Komuniti Mualaf Rumah Panjang Melanau Iban Sarawak\" /><br>\n  \n<p>Sarawak terkenal dengan longhouse (rumah panjang) indigenous communities. Ada komuniti <strong>Melanau Muslim dan Iban/Dayak mualaf</strong> yang tinggal dalam longhouse tetapi amalkan Islam!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Melanau Muslim Longhouses:</strong> Etnik pribumi yang majority Muslim - tinggal dalam longhouse tradisional but ada surau dalam longhouse! Unique fusion architecture + Islamic practice.</li>\n<li><strong>Iban/Dayak Mualaf Communities:</strong> Saudara baru yang convert to Islam tetapi maintain longhouse lifestyle. Ramadan pertama mereka sangat bersemangat!</li>\n<li><strong>Berbuka Komunal:</strong> Dalam longhouse, berbuka together sebagai extended family - 50-100 orang dalam satu ruang! Potluck style dengan makanan tradisional.</li>\n<li><strong>Remote Baram River:</strong> Ada longhouse Muslim yang hanya boleh diakses dengan bot - berbuka dalam jungle pedalaman Sarawak!</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>🛢️ Miri Offshore Oil &amp; Gas Workers</h3>\n  \n<img alt=\"Pelantar Minyak dan Gas Miri Shell PETRONAS Ramadan\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgL_rNrq2FiQl1gdUDd5inPuyj9bO75Pv37yyyVEkp_UKJg8WR9h-m4Cv11y2nevU-cbuwLRSpKgycVEXsYQb1rOnuDxfPPApEZO_ilQzi2wFzPYuxk1luPaZa0C2oUXqLv9tsrzmcvN4rBncb08D5ONsLiqB2V3LNZmPXxJZOv9gsXFunmEZHHvbO2_d4/s1600/miri-offshore-oil-gas-ramadan-shell-petronas.webp\" title=\"Panduan Pekerja Pelantar Minyak Shell dan Petronas Berbuka di Sarawak\" /><br>\n  \n<p>Miri adalah oil &amp; gas capital Sarawak - Shell, PETRONAS, Murphy Oil. <strong>4,000+ Muslim workers</strong> bekerja offshore Miri Basin!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Platform 50-150km di laut:</strong> Similar to Labuan Sarawak - berbuka dalam Miri Basin offshore fields</li>\n<li><strong>Emergency Kit:</strong> Kurma, air, jadual waktu SWK03 WAJIB ada di platform!</li>\n<li><strong>Kiblat Offshore:</strong> Arah kiblat dari Miri offshore = ~290° WNW (west-northwest)</li>\n<li><strong>LNG Bintulu (SWK04):</strong> Shell Bintulu LNG facility - largest LNG complex in the world! Ribuan Muslim workers berbuka on-site.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>🐱 Kuching Cat City - Ibu Negeri Heritage</h3>\n<p>Kuching bermaksud \"kucing\" dalam Melayu - Cat City! Ibu negeri Sarawak yang unik dengan campuran Malay kampung dan Chinese shophouses.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Kuching Waterfront:</strong> Berbuka tepi Sarawak River sambil tengok Astana (Brooke Palace) - cantik!</li>\n<li><strong>Main Bazaar:</strong> Bazaar Ramadan main area - Malay kampung section ada 80+ gerai</li>\n<li><strong>Masjid India (Masjid Jamek Kuching):</strong> Masjid tertua Kuching built 1852 - terawih heritage experience!</li>\n<li><strong>Sarawak Laksa Halal:</strong> WAJIB CUBA! Laksa Sarawak berbeza dari Penang - sambal belacan, daun ketumbar. Cari versi halal di Malay stalls!</li>\n<li><strong>Muslim-Friendly Malls:</strong> The Spring, Vivacity Megamall - ada food court halal, surau lengkap</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>🇧🇳 Limbang Brunei Border (SWK06) - Cross-Border Workers!</h3>\n  \n<img alt=\"Limbang Sarawak sempadan Brunei - panduan pekerja cross-border Ramadan waktu berbeza\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEguHyvq2863hXDlM5DnYCqI-iiTD4ok6T_cuJiGzFMCHfn-BOmcol-LT87TIxaiAPPfTIh7lJbT1fQFQr-61KQdcg-4XLQU6ZB2Ok2SDkeHIMFsGbFfy1xw63uGK7sR_w5t90BhQii_cmlZ1SFUrmyVQuv04X7t3mwNIpnJqmSA0Impx_DM4vPh6wt_g_c/s1600/sarawak-limbang-brunei-border-crossing.webp\" title=\"Waktu Berbuka Bagi Sempadan Limbang Brunei Untuk Mereka Yang Berkerja\" /><br>\n  \n<p>Limbang adalah Sarawak exclave yang terpisah dari mainland - surrounded by Brunei! Ramai pekerja cross-border Brunei-Sarawak setiap hari.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pandaruan Border:</strong> River crossing between Limbang Sarawak &amp; Brunei - similar dynamics to Perlis-Thailand!</li>\n<li><strong>Waktu Berbeda:</strong> Brunei vs Sarawak beza 3-5 minit - pekerja kena aware!</li>\n<li><strong>Shopping Brunei:</strong> Ramai Limbang residents shopping berbuka food di Brunei (no tax!) then balik Sarawak</li>\n<li><strong>Dual Citizenship Vibes:</strong> Limbang people rasa macam living in both countries - unique border town culture!</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-cta\" style=\"margin-top:6px;\">\n<p>💾 <strong>Bookmark panduan Muslim minority Sarawak ini!</strong></p>\n<button class=\"ilmx-swk-btn\" onclick=\"window.print()\">📄 Cetak Jadual</button>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"ilmx-swk-doa\">\n              <h3 style=\"color: #fff; margin-top: 10px; text-align: center;\">Doa Berbuka Puasa dari JAKIM</h3>\n                <div class=\"ilmx-swk-doa-arabic\">ذَهَبَ الظَّمَـأُ، وابْــتَلَّتِ العُرُوقُ، وثَــبَتَ الأَجْرُ إِن شَاءَ اللهُ</div>\n                <div class=\"ilmx-swk-doa-rumi\"><strong>Doa Berbuka:</strong> Dzahaba-zh Zama'u, Wabtalati-l 'Uruuqu wa Tsabata-l Ajru, Insyaa Allah</div>\n                <div class=\"ilmx-swk-doa-meaning\"><strong>Maksud:</strong> \"Telah hilang dahaga, urat-urat telah basah, dan telah diraih pahala, insya Allah.\"</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ilmx-doa-widget\">\n    <input checked=\"\" class=\"ilmx-doa-radio\" id=\"ilmx-doa-tab-sendiri\" name=\"ilmx-doa-tabs\" type=\"radio\" />\n    <input class=\"ilmx-doa-radio\" id=\"ilmx-doa-tab-ramai\" name=\"ilmx-doa-tabs\" type=\"radio\" />\n\n    <div class=\"ilmx-doa-header\">\n        <div class=\"ilmx-doa-icon\">🌙</div>\n        <h3 class=\"ilmx-doa-title\">Doa Berbuka Puasa</h3>\n        <p class=\"ilmx-doa-subtitle\">Pilih mengikut situasi anda</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ilmx-doa-tab-nav\">\n        <label class=\"ilmx-doa-tab-btn\">Sendirian</label>\n        <label class=\"ilmx-doa-tab-btn\">Beramai-ramai</label>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ilmx-doa-panels\">\n        \n        <div class=\"ilmx-doa-panel ilmx-doa-panel-sendiri\">\n            <div class=\"ilmx-doa-arabic\" dir=\"rtl\">\n                اللَّهُمَّ لَكَ صُمْتُ وَبِكَ آمَنْتُ وَعَلَى رِزْقِكَ أَفْطَرْتُ بِرَحْمَتِكَ يَا أَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِينَ\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ilmx-doa-rumi\">\n                \"Allahumma laka shumtu wa bika amantu wa'ala rizqika afthartu. Birrahmatika yaa arhamar roohimi\"\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ilmx-doa-meaning\">\n                <strong>Maksud:</strong> Ya Allah, untukMu aku berpuasa, dan kepadaMu aku beriman, dan dengan rezekiMu aku berbuka. Dengan rahmatMu wahai yang Maha Pengasih dan Penyayang.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"ilmx-doa-panel ilmx-doa-panel-ramai\">\n            <div class=\"ilmx-doa-arabic\" dir=\"rtl\">\n                اللَّهُمَّ لَكَ صُمْنَا وَبِكَ آمَنَّا وَعَلَى رِزْقِكَ أَفْطَرْنَا بِرَحْمَتِكَ يَا أَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِينَ\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ilmx-doa-rumi\">\n                \"Allahumma laka shumna wabika amanna wa'ala rizqika afthorna birohmatika ya arhamar rohimin\"\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ilmx-doa-meaning\">\n                <strong>Maksud:</strong> Ya Allah kerana Mu kami berpuasa, dengan Mu kami beriman, dengan rezekiMu kami berbuka (puasa), dengan rahmatMu Ya Allah Tuhan Maha Pengasih &amp; Penyayang.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n  \n<section style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgb(228, 245, 244) 0%, rgb(198, 247, 198) 100%); border-radius: 8px; border: 2px solid rgb(12, 56, 8); margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 16px;\">\n      <h2 style=\"color:#0c3808;\">🔗 Artikel Berkaitan yang Mungkin Anda Suka</h2>\n            📚 <strong>Ingin jadual negeri lain?</strong>\n            <p>Lawati halaman utama untuk jadual 14 negeri di Malaysia!</p>\n\n  <p>Berikut adalah senarai Jadual Waktu Berbuka Puasa dan Sahur Untuk Seluruh Malaysia berserta 14 negeri secara keseluruhan:</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500;\">\n  \t<li><a href=\"/p/jadual-imsak-berbuka-malaysia.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">14 Negeri di Malaysia</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-kl-putrajaya.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">KL &amp; Putrajaya</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-selangor.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Selangor</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-johor.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Johor</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-negeri-sembilan.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Negeri Sembilan</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-melaka.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Melaka</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-pahang.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Pahang</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-terengganu.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Terengganu</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-kelantan.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Sarawak</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-perak.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Perak</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-kedah.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Kedah</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-penang.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Pulau Pinang</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-perlis.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Perlis</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/2022/03/waktu-berbuka-puasa-sabah.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Sabah</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </section>\n      \n      <div class=\"ilmx-waktu-berbuka-sahur\">\n<p><strong class=\"ilmx-waktu-berbuka-sahur-icon\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕌 Waktu Solat Terkini Negeri Sarawak:</strong> Dapatkan <a href=\"/p/waktu-solat-malaysia.html\" rel=\"internal noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Waktu Solat Malaysia</a> mengikut lokasi walau di mana sahaja anda berada selagi anda mempunyai akses talian internet dengan auto detect location!</p>\n</div> \n  \n<div class=\"faq-schema\">\n<h2 class=\"faq-schema\">❓Soalan Lazim Jadual Waktu Berbuka &amp; Imsak Sarawak 2026 (FAQ)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"faq-schema-item\">\n<h3 class=\"faq-question\">🤔 Macam mana nak cari halal food di Kuching/Miri Chinese areas?</h3>\n<p class=\"faq-answer\"><strong>3 cara confirm halal:</strong> (1) Cari sijil JAKIM dipamer depan kedai - \"NO PORK\" alone NOT enough! (2) Nama kedai Melayu (Restoran Siti, Warung Pak Ali), (3) Tanya \"Ada sijil halal?\" - if confident answers YES with cert shown, OK! Apps \"HalalMalaysia\" ada directory by location. Muslim-majority areas: Petra Jaya (Kuching), Eastwood Valley (Miri).</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"faq-schema-item\">\n<h3 class=\"faq-question\">🤔 Longhouse Muslim communities macam mana berbuka?</h3>\n<p class=\"faq-answer\"><strong>Komunal potluck style!</strong> Melanau Muslim &amp; Iban mualaf longhouses berbuka together 50-100 orang dalam ruang communal. Ada surau dalam longhouse. Makanan tradisional (umai raw fish, pansuh bamboo cook) + standard berbuka food (kurma, air). Remote Baram River longhouses accessible by boat only - pengalaman Ramadan yang sangat unique!</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"faq-schema-item\">\n<h3 class=\"faq-question\">🤔 Miri offshore workers berbuka macam mana?</h3>\n<p class=\"faq-answer\">Similar to Labuan Sarawak! <strong>SWK03 Miri Basin offshore</strong> - Shell, PETRONAS platforms 50-150km laut. Emergency kit (kurma, air) WAJIB. Kiblat ~290° WNW. Platform ada surau atau prayer area. Bintulu SWK04 pun sama - Shell LNG facility (largest in world!) ada ribuan Muslim workers.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"faq-schema-item\">\n<h3 class=\"faq-question\">🤔 Sarawak Laksa ada versi halal ke?</h3>\n<p class=\"faq-answer\"><strong>ADA!</strong> Laksa Sarawak halal dijual di Malay stalls &amp; certified restaurants. Kuching: Laksa Ah Leng (halal branch), Lepau Restaurant. Rasa authentic sama - sambal belacan, prawns, chicken, daun ketumbar. WAJIB CUBA berbuka special Sarawak!</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"faq-schema-item\">\n<h3 class=\"faq-question\">🤔 Muslim minority 30% - bazaar Ramadan ada ke?</h3>\n<p class=\"faq-answer\"><strong>ADA tapi smaller!</strong> Kuching: Main Bazaar Petra Jaya area (80+ gerai Muslim). Miri: Eastwood Valley, Tudan area. Sibu: Malay kampung sections. Bintulu: Kidurong Town. Yes, kurang besar dari Kelantan/Pahang tapi quality tetap best! Community close-knit jadi suasana lebih mesra.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"faq-schema-item\">\n<h3 class=\"faq-question\">🤔 Limbang border Brunei - waktu berbeza berapa?</h3>\n<p class=\"faq-answer\">Brunei vs Sarawak (SWK06 Limbang) <strong>beza 3-5 minit</strong> - Brunei slightly earlier. Pekerja cross-border mesti aware! If kerja Brunei berbuka Sarawak: ikut SWK06. If kerja Sarawak berbuka Brunei: ikut Brunei timing. Emergency kit kurma+air in car WAJIB like Perlis-Thailand scenario!</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ilmx-swk-art\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n<h2>📌 Kesimpulan</h2>\n<p>Jadual rasmi <strong>JAKIM &amp; Mufti Sarawak</strong> untuk Ramadan 1447H/2026M.</p>\n<p><strong>Sarawak Bumi Kenyalang</strong> - negeri terbesar Malaysia dengan pengalaman Ramadan paling unik: Muslim minority (30%) navigate Chinese-majority cities, longhouse Muslim communities fusion culture, offshore oil workers Miri/Bintulu, Limbang-Brunei border dynamics!</p>\n<p><strong>Selamat berpuasa di Sarawak - You're Not Alone!</strong> 🌳</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:24px 0;color:#666;font-size:13px\">\n<p><strong>Sumber:</strong> JAKIM &amp; Mufti Sarawak<br>© 2026 IlmuAlam.com</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<style>\n.ilmx-swk {all:initial; display:block; max-width:100%; font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#1a1a1a; line-height:1.6; box-sizing:border-box}\n.ilmx-swk {box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0}\n.ilmx-swk-wrap {max-width:min(100%,800px); margin:0 auto; padding:0 auto}\n.ilmx-swk-hero {background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1b5e20,#388e3c 50%,#0c3808); color:#fff; padding:36px 24px; border-radius:20px; margin-bottom:26px; text-align:center; box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(27, 94, 32, .4); border-top:6px solid #ffd600}\n.ilmx-swk-hero h2 {font-size:clamp(22px,5.5vw,32px); font-weight:900; margin-bottom:12px; line-height:1.15; text-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4)}\n.ilmx-swk-hero p {font-size:15px; opacity:.96; margin-bottom:14px}\n.ilmx-swk-badges {display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap}\n.ilmx-swk-badge {background:rgba(255,255,255,.25); padding:7px 16px; border-radius:22px; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; backdrop-filter:blur(12px); border:1.5px solid rgb