boat only - pengalaman Ramadan yang sangat unique!\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"🤔 Miri offshore workers berbuka macam mana?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Similar to Labuan Sarawak! SWK03 Miri Basin offshore - Shell, PETRONAS platforms 50-150km laut. Emergency kit (kurma, air) WAJIB. Kiblat ~290° WNW. Platform ada surau atau prayer area. Bintulu SWK04 pun sama - Shell LNG facility (largest in world!) ada ribuan Muslim workers.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"🤔 Sarawak Laksa ada versi halal ke?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"ADA! Laksa Sarawak halal dijual di Malay stalls &amp; certified restaurants. Kuching: Laksa Ah Leng (halal branch), Lepau Restaurant. Rasa authentic sama - sambal belacan, prawns, chicken, daun ketumbar. WAJIB CUBA berbuka special Sarawak!\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"🤔 Muslim minority 30% - bazaar Ramadan ada ke?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"ADA tapi smaller! Kuching: Main Bazaar Petra Jaya area (80+ gerai Muslim). Miri: Eastwood Valley, Tudan area. Sibu: Malay kampung sections. Bintulu: Kidurong Town. Yes, kurang besar dari Kelantan/Pahang tapi quality tetap best! Community close-knit jadi suasana lebih mesra.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"🤔 Limbang border Brunei - waktu berbeza berapa?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Brunei vs Sarawak (SWK06 Limbang) beza 3-5 minit - Brunei slightly earlier. Pekerja cross-border mesti aware! If kerja Brunei berbuka Sarawak: ikut SWK06. If kerja Sarawak berbuka Brunei: ikut Brunei timing. Emergency kit kurma+air in car WAJIB like Perlis-Thailand scenario!\"}}]}]}</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ilmualam/ramadan@main/asset/swk.min.js?v=20260223-1.3\" defer></script>",
